1785724097476391	console-w-qw	itc:v3:AWKfJMzJnJnnxAAAAAAAQb6ttbre-AAAAAEuAw		item.comment	bn-251	{"body":"Done in workspace bn-251. Made --dx/--dy default to 0 in sprite edit shift (transform.rs run_shift); shift by (0,0) or a single axis no longer errors. Updated EDIT_USAGE to show [--dx <n>] [--dy <n>] as optional. Verified sprite edit is CLI-only (SPEC.md 'Transforms ... CLI only'); rpc.rs has no sprite_edit verb -- only view/inspection sprite_* mirrors exist -- so no serve-side change was needed. SKILL.md doesn't document shift's args explicitly (just lists shift among the ops), so left it untouched. Added 3 tests to tests/sprite_edit.rs: --dx alone, --dy alone, and no flags (0,0 no-op). cargo test --workspace green (sprite_edit.rs: 24 passed, was 20)."}	blake3:QhlOMMoR3zW8fX--TNgspZnGP2Ym9cp37T3L4Due37o
