1785724334776932	console-w-qw	itc:v3:AWKfJMzJnJnnxAAAAAAAQb6ttbre-AAAAAEuBg		item.comment	bn-2hi	{"body":"Done in workspace bn-2hi. Added --screenshot-zoom N (integer >= 1, default 1) to console-agent run: nearest-neighbor integer upscale of the PNG. Implementation: Session::screenshot_png_zoomed + encode_png_zoomed + a small standalone nearest_neighbor_scale helper in session.rs (deliberately not reusing sprite/view.rs's Canvas -- that's built around sprite-specific concerns like checkerboard transparency and index glyphs, not a plain screen framebuffer). Also added an optional zoom param (default 1, backward compatible) to serve's screenshot RPC verb since it shares the PNG path. Updated SPEC.md's oneshot flag list and screenshot RPC verb doc, plus SKILL.md's dev-loop example, since both document the harness flags/verbs explicitly. Tests: oneshot.rs arg-parsing tests (zoom defaults to 1, zoom 0 rejected) plus two new serve_integration.rs tests asserting PNG dimensions via IHDR (576x1024 for zoom 4, both CLI and RPC paths). cargo test --workspace green. Manually verified: cargo run -p console-agent --release -- run carts/demo.cart --frames 10 --screenshot /tmp/z4.png --screenshot-zoom 4 -> confirmed 576x1024 PNG."}	blake3:evmQs-3uUoj9RFxIBxfjaA8wS5GUBfWiE2UKxIHUuD0
