1785726391833900	console-w-34g	itc:v3:AWLJM-ckySZnPEAAAAAAQdW-6tVt3gAAAAEwBA		item.comment	bn-34g	{"body":"DONE (cf87bc1 in .maw/workspaces/bn-34g, not merged).\n\nDesign: delay in whole FRAMES 1-60 (735 samples each, 16.7ms-1s; integer read index, ~= SNES EDL 16ms grid, and rows are already frames so tempo sync is head math). feedback = f*7/64, MAX 7/8 = 0.875, strictly sub-unity so the loop always decays (the loop LP has DC gain 1 and can't be relied on). level + per-inst send are eighths n/8. One-pole LP INSIDE the feedback loop, a=0.49534696 (4800 Hz, authoring-time, no exp at runtime). Sends taken post-duck; return added pre-MIX_GAIN. Fixed 44100-sample zero-init buffer allocated once (alloc_zeroed, no stack temp); zero allocation in step().\n\nGoldens: ALL THREE EXISTING UNCHANGED (0xbc2bd5e1f8c7f31e / 0x993ee5118be1bec4 / 0xba780b637bd94ac3). New SOUNDTEST_ECHO_GOLDEN 0x7a66500c06d8d557.\n\nFiles: crates/console-core/src/{audio.rs,api.rs,lib.rs,cart.rs (accessor only, 8 lines - no parsing touched)}, crates/console-core/tests/audio.rs, carts/soundtest.cart, SPEC.md, skills/build-cart/SKILL.md.\n\ncargo test --workspace green (348 tests), clippy clean.\n\nLEAD: engine.js rebuild NEEDED (new feature must ship in wasm; web/smoke.cjs AUDIO_GOLDEN is unchanged so the current engine still passes smoke, but carts using echo need the rebuild). soundtest.cart CHANGED -> repack dist."}	blake3:ACyeWaS23gWkbSuWoC1a37srWUY4Qlh_O1FJSh4BR7Y
1785726423378070	console-w-13m	itc:v3:AWLkzJkkmcnknJEAAAAAQetrVW69XUAAAAEzAw		item.comment	bn-13m	{"body":"Rewrote README.md in workspace bn-13m (commit 630b1f1). Verified against current SPEC.md: 7 buttons (added menu), 6 audio channels, persistent draw state, runtime tile map. Added specs-at-a-glance table, layout table, quickstart (built release binaries and actually ran console-agent run with --screenshot-zoom and console-pack against carts/demo.cart, both succeeded; also ran cargo test --workspace and node web/smoke.cjs, all green), a 'for AI agents' section pointing to skills/build-cart/SKILL.md and console-agent serve, a one-line pointer to AGENTS.md for the bones/maw workflow, and a status line noting no LICENSE exists yet. No name/logo invented per instructions. Ready for lead to review/merge."}	blake3:X5jFdwBZpeDBCACNpd9rKcE3PjUmTIR6_KgEgPdxAD4
