1785726725168316	console-w-qw2	itc:v3:AWLJJyZk5JmSeZQAAAAAQdV1tdW1e0AAAAEyCQ		item.comment	bn-1wu	{"body":"Implemented in workspace bn-1wu. console-agent sprite gif <cart> <anim> [--zoom 8] [--grid] [--anchor] -o out.gif encodes an animated preview at the anim's declared __gfx_meta__ fps. Delay = round(1000/fps) in GIF's 10ms units, floored at 2; always Repeat::Infinite since GIF viewers loop regardless of the SPEC loop flag (documented in the doc comment, not silently ignored). Color 0 bakes in the same checkerboard as the PNG views (no GIF transparency) so --grid/--anchor overlays reuse draw_grid/draw_anchor/Canvas verbatim. Added gif crate to console-agent/Cargo.toml: default-features=false, features=[std,color_quant] (dropped raii_no_panic -- encoder finalized explicitly via into_inner() rather than relying on Drop). New view::GifOpts{zoom,grid,anchor} and view::GifOutput{bytes,width,height,frames}; gif is CLI-only (no RPC mirror -- noted in the module doc comment, an animated preview has no single-frame RPC shape to mirror). Tests in tests/sprite_gif.rs (6 tests): encodes carts/demo.cart's player.walk (4 frames, fps=8) and decodes it back with the gif crate's own reader verifying frame count (4) and dimensions (32x32 at zoom4, 64x64 at default zoom8); fps-to-delay rounding (125ms -> 13 hundredths); grid/anchor changing encoded bytes without changing shape; non-anim-target error; CLI round-trip through the real binary. cargo test --workspace green (all suites, including the tile-map and echo-bus work merged to main by other core workers during this bone), cargo clippy clean. SKILL.md updated with the gif line. Committed at b93ccfc. Not merged -- awaiting lead. Note: like bn-2r6, this workspace was created --from main per protocol and does not include bn-3gj's dump/poke or bn-2r6's onion --all/OverlayOpts changes to view.rs/mod.rs -- three-way merge needed across all three sprite bones (regions touched are largely disjoint: bn-3gj added dump()+cli wiring, bn-2r6 changed onion/ghost signatures to OverlayOpts and added onion_all, bn-1wu added gif()+GifOpts/GifOutput+cli wiring -- but a real cargo build after merge is essential since mod.rs's SPRITE_USAGE/cli_sprite dispatch and view.rs's shared Canvas/Rect/draw_* helpers are touched by all three)."}	blake3:R3NUilsvX5QEEeYmsbTewE6msQKiClMZF7qdHyRkb24
