1785727873894839	console-w-1xl	itc:v3:AWLJ58n5_nJQAAAAAAAAQde-v3-6gAAAAAEpAw		item.comment	bn-1xl	{"body":"Wavetables landed in ws bn-1xl (commit d421cef), cargo test --workspace green (22 suites, 112 in tests/audio.rs).\n\nSYNTAX: `wavetable <slot 0-7> <32 hex nibbles>` in __instruments__ (nibbles may be split into whitespace groups); `inst <name> wave=w<slot>`; a bare `w<slot>` is also legal in a sfx row's wave column, exactly like a wave digit. Internal wave ids 8..=15 (6/7 left free for the coming FM/periodic-noise oscillators), so audio_state/audio_events report 8+slot. Instrument names matching w<digits> are now reserved.\n\nMAPPING: (2n-15)/15 — code 0 = -1.0, f = +1.0, symmetric. Chosen over /16 so wavetables reach the same full scale as builtins: 'ffffffffffffffff0000000000000000' IS the builtin square, sample for sample (pinned by a test). 4 bits have no zero: codes 7/8 straddle it at -+1/15, so an all-8 table is a +0.0667 DC offset, not silence — documented, and Wavetable::dc_sum() makes 'is this table centred' decidable (pair every 8 with a 7).\n\nINTERPOLATION: none. phase >> 27 is the index (32 entries, exact). The step aliasing is the character; also the cheapest read. Documented that linear would be deterministic, so a future per-instrument interp= flag stays open.\n\nGOLDENS: DEMO/GROOVE/AB/ECHO all unchanged (no cart without a wavetable line can produce a wave id > 5). New: SOUNDTEST_WAVETABLE_GOLDEN = 0xf8c700f2fd628f7b (menu index 15, pattern 14, 150 frames, seed 0).\n\nSOUNDTEST: entry 16 'WAVETABLE W0-W2' appended at the end (pattern 14): w0 hollow (odd harmonics, GB-ish), w1 organ (drawbars), w2 buzz (double saw). Lead alternates hollow/buzz across two bars over a held organ pad; buzz carries vib + an arp/slide row so composition is audible. All three tables are DC-free and full-scale. Menu layout retuned for 16 rows: top=22->20, meter 144->148 at an 8px pitch (the old 9px pitch would have run bar 16 off the 144px screen). Screenshotted at both a mid-menu and the last entry: no overlap. audio_stats: peak 0.36, 0 clipped. Determinism double-run: identical WAV + screen_text.\n\nFILES: crates/console-core/src/{audio.rs,cart.rs,lib.rs}, crates/console-core/tests/audio.rs, carts/soundtest.cart, SPEC.md, skills/build-cart/SKILL.md, README.md. No gfx.rs/api.rs changes (no overlap with the fillp/sspr worker).\n\nINTEGRATION: engine rebuild + dist repack needed — soundtest.cart changed and console-core's synth changed."}	blake3:ZWlLF6-fT3Gr2lZxeJs8uoOoiAN5aAMSUnFdabSFL-M
