1785729034468445	console-w-2tf	itc:v3:AWLJMn_kySfmUAAAAAAAQdWv_Wq_aAAAAAEtAw		item.comment	bn-2tf	{"body":"Implemented map agent tooling in console-agent: `map render/dump/poke/lint/edit`, mirroring the sprite tooling's three-layer philosophy (data -> numbers -> pictures) and atomic cart-rewrite pattern.\n\nCommands:\n- map render <cart> [cx,cy,cw,ch] [--zoom Z] [--grid] [--ids] -o out.png -- reuses sprite::view's Canvas/checkerboard/draw_frame/draw_grid primitives (bumped to pub(crate) in sprite/view.rs) so a rendered tile is pixel-identical to sprite render <tx,ty,8,8>. --ids overlays a 2-hex-digit glyph per non-empty cell.\n- map dump / map poke -- hex-row read/write pair mirroring sprite dump/poke's UX exactly; map dump | map poke --stdin round-trips as a no-op (tested). poke creates __map__ if absent, inserted after __sprites__ (or before __gfx_meta__, or EOF) per SPEC's cart anatomy.\n- map lint -- JSON: used_extent, tile_counts (top 16), blank_sprite_tiles (tile ids referenced whose sheet region is all-zero -- the map analog of sprite lint's 'color unique to one frame'), fill_pct. Cheap, whole-map scan.\n- map edit copy|shift|fill|clear -- atomic, only-touch-changed-lines rewrites mirroring sprite edit. Region is ALWAYS explicit for edit (destructive), but defaults to the used extent for render/dump/poke when omitted.\n- RPC: map_render, map_dump, map_lint added as read-only mirrors (no map_poke/map_edit verb), matching the sprite_* convention documented in rpc.rs.\n\nUX decisions:\n- Region syntax cx,cy,cw,ch (cell coords), matching sprite's tx,ty,w,h rect convention.\n- fill/clear/poke use the __map__ hex alphabet directly (1-2 hex digits, 00-ff).\n- Changed __map__ rows are always rewritten at full 128-cell width (mirrors sprite::transform::encode_row's full-width convention).\n\nFiles touched: crates/console-agent/src/map/{mod,view,transform}.rs (new), crates/console-agent/src/sprite/view.rs (visibility bumps to pub(crate) for Canvas/Rect/Frame/read_rect/draw_frame/draw_grid/check_zoom/GLYPHS/INK_LIGHT/INK_DARK/luminance -- no behavior change), crates/console-agent/src/lib.rs (wire 'map' subcommand), crates/console-agent/src/rpc.rs (map_* verbs), crates/console-agent/tests/map_{view,poke,edit}.rs (new, 47 tests total), SPEC.md + skills/build-cart/SKILL.md (docs).\n\nTests: cargo test --workspace green (all crates), including the 47 new map tests (render dims/pixels/grid/ids, dump/lint numbers pinned on a hand-built fixture, poke round-trip + section-creation + error paths, edit ops incl. overlap-safe copy). No console-core changes. Did not touch demo.cart.\n\nMerge notes: SKILL.md and SPEC.md are shared docs -- my diffs are additive sections (Map agent tooling / Tile map agent tooling) plus one small edit to SPEC's Out-of-scope list (removed the now-stale 'map authoring/preview tooling' entry). Workspace based on epoch 190f0d0f6e15 (includes the wavetable-instruments commit from the concurrent console-core worker); no conflicts expected since I only touched console-agent + docs."}	blake3:M7Yd1umSBCuwQkYOaPB3kLs1oqB69DGqaspG8c9-9Is
